<title>USA: BRT Realty sets buyback for 250,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>BRT Realty sets buyback for 250,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRT Realty Trust said Tuesday it authorized a repurchase plan for 250,00 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The new plan is additional to the existing plan, which was recently concluded, the company said in a press release.</p>
<p>The concluded plan, which was announced July 2, 1996, repurchased 250,000 shares, leaving 8,525,225 shares outstanding, BRT Realty said.</p>
</text>
